      "example": {"text":"Stricter building codes can reduce the number of deaths caused by a powerful earthquake.","translationZh":"更严格的建筑规范可以减少强震造成的死亡人数。","target":"earthquake","sourceType":"original-ielts-style","copyrightStatus":"Original for 词穹; not copied from an IELTS test."},
      "provenance": {"contentAuthor":"词穹编辑示范","linguisticSources":["原始词库词义","standard geographical usage"],"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-10-15"}
    },
    {
      "wordId": "l1-58", "partOfSpeech": ["noun"],
      "memoryAid": {"kind":"word-family","noteZh":"glacier 是冰川；相关形容词 glacial 表示“冰川的”或“冰冷的”。"},
