      "example": {"text":"The retreating glacier provides visible evidence of long-term changes in the regional climate.","translationZh":"不断退缩的冰川为区域气候的长期变化提供了直观证据。","target":"glacier","sourceType":"original-ielts-style","copyrightStatus":"Original for 词穹; not copied from an IELTS test."},
