      "example": {"text":"Communities on the high plateau have adapted their farming methods to the short growing season.","translationZh":"高原上的社区已经调整耕作方式，以适应较短的生长季。","target":"plateau","sourceType":"original-ielts-style","copyrightStatus":"Original for 词穹; not copied from an IELTS test."},
