      "example": {"text":"More intense storms may erode the coastline faster than natural processes can restore it.","translationZh":"更强烈的风暴可能侵蚀海岸线，其速度超过自然过程的修复能力。","target":"erode","sourceType":"original-ielts-style","copyrightStatus":"Original for 词穹; not copied from an IELTS test."},
      "provenance": {"contentAuthor":"词穹编辑示范","linguisticSources":["原始词库词义","standard environmental usage"],"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-10-15"}
